Hi Mark:

After I have obtained the statistically significant differentially expression(DE) exons between the two groups using limma, I want further to explore the splicing pattern of the DE exons in each group. As I know, for each array, FIRMA scores each exon as to whether its probes systematically deviate from the expected gene expression level. Is there any way to get a summary of firma score for each exon across all the arrays belonging to the same group? Thanks!

Xinjun

